sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Workflow Engine
  participant P as Policy Engine
  participant A as Agent
  participant S as Schema Validator
  participant E as Evidence Store
  participant L as Provenance Ledger
  participant H as Human Reviewer

  W->>P: authorize(task, inputs, capabilities)
  P-->>W: permit / deny / human-gate-required
  W->>A: TaskEnvelope(input_artifact_ids, schema_version, constraints)
  A->>E: read immutable inputs
  A->>A: execute in bounded environment
  A->>S: AgentResult(output, evidence, confidence, warnings)
  S-->>A: valid / invalid with errors
  A->>L: record inputs, model, prompt hash, code version, output hash
  A-->>W: validated result or explicit failure
  W->>P: evaluate integrity rules
  P-->>W: continue / revise / block
  W->>H: approval request when required
  H-->>W: approve / reject / request revision
  W->>E: commit versioned output artifact

  Note over A,L: Agents propose artifacts, they do not silently mutate raw data.
  Note over P,H: Human overrides are explicit, scoped, and auditable.
